  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Farmington, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Commissions   \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t All Town Clerk / Tax Collector Meeting Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Credit Card / Debit Card Information \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Farmington Annual Reports 2006 & Earlier \r\n\t\t\t Farmington Annual Reports 2007 to 2013 \r\n\t\t\t Helpful Links & Documents \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Real Estate Tax Information (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t Tax Maps \r\n\t\t\t Town Meeting Information & Town Reports \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nThe General Elections are coming up on Tuesday, November 3rd! Take a look at the  Sample Ballot  early and see you at the polls! \nNew Hampshire State primary election was held Tuesday, September 8th. Results can be found below \n2026 State Primary Results \n***NEW***  You can now estimate the cost of your vehicle registration by visiting the  NH DMV Online Services Portal . Just have your vehicle VIN handy and they will calculate the cost* \n*Some fees and taxes may apply upon processing your registration, the above link will calculate an estimate that may differ slightly when transaction is processed. \nOnline payments . We have a separate portal for Taxes/Utility and another for Auto/Dogs/Vital Records.. \nVisit for an  Absentee Ballot  Request. Please call with any questions 603-755-3657 \nStaff Contacts \nSamuel Jerome, Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nErica Knapp, Deputy Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nPamela Nason, Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nPat Sirrell, Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nFAQs \r\n             When do I have to register my dog? \r\n             What documents do I need to register my vehicle? \r\n             How do I get a certified copy of a birth, death, marriage, or civil union certificate? \r\n             How do I get a marriage license? \r\n             How do I get a fishing / hunting license? \r\n             How do I register a boat? \r\n             How do I apply for a NH driver's license? \r\n             We do not carry 20 Day Plates. Click here for information. \r\n             New Registration Information \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tSamuel Jerome\r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nEmail the Town Clerk  \r\nPhone:  603-755-3657 Ext. 28 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTown Clerk/Tax Collector Office\r\nEmail the Town Clerk/Tax Collector Office  \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 356 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Farmington ,  NH   03835 \r\nPhone:  603-755-3657 \r\nFax: 603-755-9934 \r\nHours \nMonday \n8:30 am to 5 pm \nTuesday \n8:30 am to 5 pm \nWednesday \n8:30 am to 5 pm \nThursday \n8:30 am to 7 pm \nFriday \n8:30 am to 12:30 pm \r\n\t\t\t FAQs \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \r\n\t\t\t Online Dog, Motor Vehicle, & Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Online Tax and Water/Sewer Payment \r\n\t\t\t Building Permits \r\n\t\t\t Tax Assessments \r\nTown of Farmington \r\nFarmington Municipal Offices \r\n356 Main Street \r\nFarmington, NH 03835 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
